#: templates/index.htm:625
msgid ""
"\n"
"                                        Anyone can search the IPAD Indonesian Prehistoric Archaeology Database\n"
"                                        without signing in. Open Search, use the map and filters to find\n"
"                                        prehistoric archaeological sites, then click a result to read the report.\n"
"                                    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Siapa pun dapat mencari IPAD Indonesian Prehistoric Archaeology Database tanpa masuk akun. Buka Pencarian, gunakan peta dan filter untuk menemukan situs arkeologi prasejarah, lalu klik hasil untuk membaca laporan."

#: templates/index.htm:639
msgid "IPAD search map"
msgstr "Peta pencarian IPAD"

#: templates/index.htm:648
msgid "Map"
msgstr "Peta"

#: templates/index.htm:650
msgid ""
"\n"
"                                        Use the map to locate prehistoric archaeological sites. Pan and zoom,\n"
"                                        then click a result to open the site report.\n"
"                                    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Gunakan peta untuk menemukan situs arkeologi prasejarah. Geser dan perbesar, lalu klik hasil untuk membuka laporan situs."

#: templates/index.htm:656
msgid "IPAD map and search results"
msgstr "Peta IPAD dan hasil pencarian"

#: templates/index.htm:663
msgid "Filters"
msgstr "Filter"

#: templates/index.htm:665
msgid ""
"\n"
"                                        Apply filters to narrow the list of sites, then open a result to read\n"
"                                        the report.\n"
"                                    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Terapkan filter untuk mempersempit daftar situs, lalu buka hasil untuk membaca laporan."

