#: templates/pages/accessibility.htm:9
msgid ""
"This accessibility statement applies to the <strong>IPAD Indonesian "
"Prehistoric Archaeology Database</strong> (“IPAD”, “we”, “us”) website. "
"After this first mention we usually say “IPAD”."
msgstr ""
"Pernyataan aksesibilitas ini berlaku untuk situs web <strong>IPAD Indonesian"
" Prehistoric Archaeology Database</strong> (“IPAD”, “kami”). Setelah "
"penyebutan pertama ini kami biasanya menyebut “IPAD”."

#: templates/pages/accessibility.htm:10
msgid ""
"This website is run by IPAD. We want as many people as possible to be able "
"to use this website. For example, that means you should be able to:"
msgstr ""
"Situs web ini dikelola oleh IPAD. Kami ingin sebanyak mungkin orang dapat "
"menggunakan situs ini. Misalnya, Anda seharusnya dapat:"

#: templates/pages/accessibility.htm:12
msgid ""
"change colours, contrast levels, and fonts using your browser or device "
"settings"
msgstr ""
"mengubah warna, tingkat kontras, dan jenis huruf melalui pengaturan peramban"
" atau perangkat"

#: templates/pages/accessibility.htm:13
#, python-format
msgid ""
"zoom in up to 300%% without the text spilling off the screen on most pages"
msgstr ""
"memperbesar hingga 300%% tanpa teks keluar dari layar pada sebagian besar "
"halaman"

#: templates/pages/accessibility.htm:14
msgid "navigate most of the website using just a keyboard"
msgstr "menavigasi sebagian besar situs hanya dengan papan ketik"

#: templates/pages/accessibility.htm:15
msgid "navigate most of the website using speech recognition software"
msgstr ""
"menavigasi sebagian besar situs dengan perangkat lunak pengenal ucapan"

#: templates/pages/accessibility.htm:16
msgid ""
"listen to most of the website using a screen reader (including recent "
"versions of JAWS, NVDA, and VoiceOver)"
msgstr ""
"mendengarkan sebagian besar situs dengan pembaca layar (termasuk versi "
"terbaru JAWS, NVDA, dan VoiceOver)"

#: templates/pages/accessibility.htm:18
msgid ""
"We have also tried to keep the website text as simple as possible to "
"understand."
msgstr "Kami juga berupaya menuliskan teks situs agar mudah dipahami."

#: templates/pages/accessibility.htm:20
msgid "How accessible this website is"
msgstr "Seberapa aksesibel situs ini"

#: templates/pages/accessibility.htm:21
msgid "We know some parts of this website are not fully accessible:"
msgstr "Kami tahu beberapa bagian situs ini belum sepenuhnya aksesibel:"

#: templates/pages/accessibility.htm:23
msgid ""
"maps used in search and resource views may be difficult to navigate with a "
"keyboard alone and hard to read for users with a visual impairment"
msgstr ""
"peta pada tampilan pencarian dan sumber daya mungkin sulit dinavigasi hanya "
"dengan papan ketik dan sulit dibaca bagi pengguna dengan gangguan "
"penglihatan"

#: templates/pages/accessibility.htm:24
msgid "some map colours and contrast may not meet recommended contrast levels"
msgstr ""
"beberapa warna dan kontras peta mungkin tidak memenuhi tingkat kontras yang "
"disarankan"

#: templates/pages/accessibility.htm:25
msgid ""
"some heritage images or archival reproductions may not have alternative text"
msgstr ""
"beberapa gambar warisan atau reproduksi arsip mungkin tidak memiliki teks "
"alternatif"

#: templates/pages/accessibility.htm:26
msgid ""
"parts of the Arches application interface (for example complex editors used "
"by staff) may be harder to use with assistive technology than these "
"information pages"
msgstr ""
"bagian antarmuka aplikasi Arches (misalnya penyunting kompleks yang "
"digunakan staf) mungkin lebih sulit digunakan dengan teknologi asistif "
"dibanding halaman informasi ini"

#: templates/pages/accessibility.htm:28
msgid ""
"Search tools that do not rely on the map remain available so that record "
"information can be found as text."
msgstr ""
"Alat pencarian yang tidak bergantung pada peta tetap tersedia sehingga "
"informasi rekaman dapat ditemukan sebagai teks."

#: templates/pages/accessibility.htm:30
msgid "Feedback and contact information"
msgstr "Umpan balik dan informasi kontak"

#: templates/pages/accessibility.htm:31
msgid ""
"If you need information on this website in a different format, such as large"
" print, easy read, or another accessible file:"
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda memerlukan informasi di situs ini dalam format lain, misalnya "
"cetak besar, easy read, atau berkas aksesibel lainnya:"

#: templates/pages/accessibility.htm:33
msgid "email cata@nusantaraheritage.org (plain text; this is not a mail link)"
msgstr "surel cata@nusantaraheritage.org (teks biasa; ini bukan tautan surel)"

#: templates/pages/accessibility.htm:35
msgid "We will consider your request and get back to you."
msgstr "Kami akan mempertimbangkan permintaan Anda dan menghubungi kembali."

#: templates/pages/accessibility.htm:37
msgid "Reporting accessibility problems with this website"
msgstr "Melaporkan masalah aksesibilitas pada situs ini"

#: templates/pages/accessibility.htm:38
msgid ""
"We are always looking to improve the accessibility of this website. If you "
"find any problems not listed on this page, or think we are not meeting the "
"aims described here, email cata@nusantaraheritage.org."
msgstr ""
"Kami selalu berupaya meningkatkan aksesibilitas situs ini. Jika Anda "
"menemukan masalah yang tidak tercantum di halaman ini, atau merasa kami "
"belum memenuhi tujuan yang diuraikan di sini, kirim surel ke "
"cata@nusantaraheritage.org."

#: templates/pages/accessibility.htm:42
msgid "Technical information about this website’s accessibility"
msgstr "Informasi teknis tentang aksesibilitas situs ini"

#: templates/pages/accessibility.htm:43
msgid ""
"IPAD aims to make this website accessible. We use the Web Content "
"Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) version 2.2, Level AA, as our technical "
"reference. WCAG is an international standard; this page does not claim "
"compliance with any particular national accessibility statute until that is "
"confirmed."
msgstr ""
"IPAD bertujuan membuat situs ini aksesibel. Kami menggunakan Web Content "
"Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) versi 2.2, Level AA, sebagai rujukan teknis."
" WCAG adalah standar internasional; halaman ini tidak mengklaim kepatuhan "
"terhadap undang-undang aksesibilitas nasional tertentu sampai hal itu "
"dikonfirmasi."

#: templates/pages/accessibility.htm:45
msgid "Compliance status"
msgstr "Status kepatuhan"

#: templates/pages/accessibility.htm:46
msgid ""
"This website has not yet had a full independent accessibility audit for "
"IPAD. Until that work is done, we treat the site as only partially meeting "
"WCAG 2.2 Level AA, because of the map, image, and interface issues listed "
"above."
msgstr ""
"Situs ini belum menjalani audit aksesibilitas independen penuh untuk IPAD. "
"Sampai pekerjaan itu selesai, kami menganggap situs ini hanya sebagian "
"memenuhi WCAG 2.2 Level AA, karena isu peta, gambar, dan antarmuka yang "
"tercantum di atas."

#: templates/pages/accessibility.htm:48
msgid "Non-accessible content"
msgstr "Konten yang tidak sepenuhnya aksesibel"

#: templates/pages/accessibility.htm:49
msgid ""
"The content listed below is not fully accessible for the following reasons."
msgstr "Konten di bawah ini belum sepenuhnya aksesibel karena alasan berikut."

#: templates/pages/accessibility.htm:51
msgid ""
"Online maps: keyboard access, colour, and contrast can fail recommended "
"criteria. Essential record information is also available through text "
"search."
msgstr ""
"Peta daring: akses papan ketik, warna, dan kontras dapat gagal memenuhi "
"kriteria yang disarankan. Informasi rekaman penting juga tersedia melalui "
"pencarian teks."

#: templates/pages/accessibility.htm:52
msgid "Images: some photographs and figures may lack alternative text."
msgstr ""
"Gambar: beberapa foto dan gambar mungkin tidak memiliki teks alternatif."

#: templates/pages/accessibility.htm:53
msgid ""
"Staff-only editors and workflows in Arches may not yet meet the same "
"standard as these public information pages."
msgstr ""
"Penyunting dan alur kerja khusus staf di Arches mungkin belum memenuhi "
"standar yang sama dengan halaman informasi publik ini."

#: templates/pages/accessibility.htm:57
msgid "What we are doing to improve accessibility"
msgstr "Apa yang kami lakukan untuk meningkatkan aksesibilitas"

#: templates/pages/accessibility.htm:58
msgid ""
"It is IPAD’s intention to improve accessibility over time. We will review "
"this statement when we complete testing or when we make significant changes "
"to the public interface."
msgstr ""
"IPAD berencana meningkatkan aksesibilitas dari waktu ke waktu. Kami akan "
"meninjau pernyataan ini setelah pengujian selesai atau ketika kami membuat "
"perubahan signifikan pada antarmuka publik."

#: templates/pages/accessibility.htm:60
msgid "Preparation of this accessibility statement"
msgstr "Penyusunan pernyataan aksesibilitas ini"

#: templates/pages/accessibility.htm:61
msgid ""
"This statement was prepared on 24 August 2026 for the IPAD public Arches "
"site. It was adapted from the structure of comparable heritage-database "
"accessibility statements. It has not yet been validated by an external "
"accessibility agency for this IPAD installation."
msgstr ""
"Pernyataan ini disusun pada 24 Agustus 2026 untuk situs Arches publik IPAD. "
"Strukturnya diadaptasi dari pernyataan aksesibilitas basis data warisan yang"
" sebanding. Belum divalidasi oleh lembaga aksesibilitas eksternal untuk "
"instalasi IPAD ini."

#: templates/pages/cookies.htm:9
msgid ""
"This page explains how the <strong>IPAD Indonesian Prehistoric Archaeology "
"Database</strong> (“IPAD”, “we”, “us”) uses cookies on this website. After "
"this first mention we usually say “IPAD”."
msgstr ""
"Halaman ini menjelaskan bagaimana <strong>IPAD Indonesian Prehistoric "
"Archaeology Database</strong> (“IPAD”, “kami”) menggunakan kuki di situs web"
" ini. Setelah penyebutan pertama ini kami biasanya menyebut “IPAD”."

#: templates/pages/cookies.htm:10
msgid ""
"Cookies are small files saved on your phone, tablet, or computer when you "
"visit a website. They save some information about you when you use the "
"website. They do not usually identify you directly, just the device you use."
msgstr ""
"Kuki adalah berkas kecil yang disimpan di ponsel, tablet, atau komputer Anda"
" saat mengunjungi situs web. Kuki menyimpan sebagian informasi tentang Anda "
"saat menggunakan situs. Biasanya kuki tidak mengidentifikasi Anda secara "
"langsung, hanya perangkat yang digunakan."

#: templates/pages/cookies.htm:12
msgid "About cookies"
msgstr "Tentang kuki"

#: templates/pages/cookies.htm:13
msgid "We use cookies so that this website can function, for example:"
msgstr "Kami menggunakan kuki agar situs ini dapat berfungsi, misalnya:"

#: templates/pages/cookies.htm:15
msgid ""
"enabling a service to recognise your device so you do not have to give the "
"same information several times during a task"
msgstr ""
"memungkinkan layanan mengenali perangkat Anda sehingga Anda tidak perlu "
"memberikan informasi yang sama berulang kali dalam satu tugas"

#: templates/pages/cookies.htm:16
msgid ""
"recognising that you may already have given a username and password, so you "
"do not need to do it for every page that needs those details"
msgstr ""
"mengenali bahwa Anda mungkin sudah memberikan nama pengguna dan kata sandi, "
"sehingga tidak perlu mengulanginya di setiap halaman yang membutuhkan data "
"itu"

#: templates/pages/cookies.htm:17
msgid "protecting forms and requests from being misused by other websites"
msgstr ""
"melindungi formulir dan permintaan agar tidak disalahgunakan oleh situs lain"

#: templates/pages/cookies.htm:19
msgid ""
"This page describes cookies. It is not a cookie-consent product and it does "
"not load any third-party cookie control widget."
msgstr ""
"Halaman ini menjelaskan kuki. Ini bukan produk persetujuan kuki dan tidak "
"memuat widget pengontrol kuki pihak ketiga."

#: templates/pages/cookies.htm:21
msgid "Necessary cookies"
msgstr "Kuki yang diperlukan"

#: templates/pages/cookies.htm:22
msgid ""
"Necessary cookies are required for this site to function. They support "
"security, session management, network operation, and accessibility. We do "
"not ask extra permission to use those essential cookies."
msgstr ""
"Kuki yang diperlukan wajib agar situs ini berfungsi. Kuki ini mendukung "
"keamanan, pengelolaan sesi, operasi jaringan, dan aksesibilitas. Kami tidak "
"meminta izin tambahan untuk menggunakan kuki esensial tersebut."

#: templates/pages/cookies.htm:24
msgid "How to manage cookies on your computer"
msgstr "Cara mengelola kuki di komputer Anda"

#: templates/pages/cookies.htm:25
msgid ""
"You can manage these small files yourself using your web browser settings. "
"Use the help function in your browser to find out more about managing your "
"cookie settings."
msgstr ""
"Anda dapat mengelola berkas kecil ini sendiri melalui pengaturan peramban. "
"Gunakan fungsi bantuan di peramban untuk mempelajari pengaturan kuki."

#: templates/pages/cookies.htm:26
msgid ""
"Restricting cookies may affect the functionality of this website. In "
"particular, you may not be able to sign in or complete forms if you block "
"cookies that the site needs in order to run."
msgstr ""
"Membatasi kuki dapat memengaruhi fungsi situs ini. Khususnya, Anda mungkin "
"tidak dapat masuk atau mengisi formulir jika memblokir kuki yang dibutuhkan "
"situs untuk berjalan."

#: templates/pages/cookies.htm:28
msgid "Cookies this site uses"
msgstr "Kuki yang digunakan situs ini"

#: templates/pages/cookies.htm:29
msgid ""
"This site is an Arches application. It sets first-party cookies that are "
"needed to run the service. We do not currently set analytics or marketing "
"cookies, and we do not currently use Google Analytics on this site."
msgstr ""
"Situs ini adalah aplikasi Arches. Situs menetapkan kuki pihak pertama yang "
"diperlukan untuk menjalankan layanan. Saat ini kami tidak menetapkan kuki "
"analitik atau pemasaran, dan tidak menggunakan Google Analytics di situs "
"ini."

#: templates/pages/cookies.htm:34
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Nama"

#: templates/pages/cookies.htm:35
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "Tujuan"

#: templates/pages/cookies.htm:36
msgid "Typical lifetime"
msgstr "Masa berlaku umum"

#: templates/pages/cookies.htm:42
msgid ""
"Keeps you signed in (when you have an account) and maintains your session as"
" you move from page to page"
msgstr ""
"Menjaga Anda tetap masuk (jika punya akun) dan mempertahankan sesi saat "
"berpindah halaman"

#: templates/pages/cookies.htm:43
msgid "Until you close the browser, or as configured on the server"
msgstr "Sampai Anda menutup peramban, atau sesuai konfigurasi server"

#: templates/pages/cookies.htm:47
msgid "Protects forms and requests from cross-site request forgery"
msgstr ""
"Melindungi formulir dan permintaan dari pemalsuan permintaan lintas situs"

#: templates/pages/cookies.htm:48
msgid "Typically up to one year"
msgstr "Biasanya hingga satu tahun"

#: templates/pages/cookies.htm:52
msgid "Remembers a language preference if the language switcher is used"
msgstr "Mengingat preferensi bahasa jika pemilih bahasa digunakan"

#: templates/pages/cookies.htm:53
msgid "As configured; often until you clear cookies"
msgstr "Sesuai konfigurasi; sering hingga Anda menghapus kuki"

#: templates/pages/cookies.htm:58
msgid ""
"Your browser may also store cookies that you have chosen to allow from other"
" sites. IPAD has no control over those cookies."
msgstr ""
"Peramban Anda juga dapat menyimpan kuki yang Anda izinkan dari situs lain. "
"IPAD tidak mengendalikan kuki tersebut."

#: templates/pages/cookies.htm:60
msgid "Analytics and marketing cookies"
msgstr "Kuki analitik dan pemasaran"

#: templates/pages/cookies.htm:61
msgid ""
"The IPAD Indonesian Prehistoric Archaeology Database does not currently use "
"analytics or marketing cookies. Optional analytics or marketing cookies "
"would only be used with the visitor’s permission. If that changes, "
"permission will be sought and this page will be updated first."
msgstr ""
"IPAD Indonesian Prehistoric Archaeology Database saat ini tidak menggunakan "
"kuki analitik atau pemasaran. Kuki analitik atau pemasaran opsional hanya "
"akan digunakan dengan izin pengunjung. Jika itu berubah, izin akan diminta "
"dan halaman ini akan diperbarui terlebih dahulu."

#: templates/pages/cookies.htm:63
msgid "Related pages"
msgstr "Halaman terkait"

#: templates/pages/cookies.htm:64
msgid ""
"How we use personal information is described on the Privacy policy page. "
"Using this site is also subject to the Terms & conditions page."
msgstr ""
"Cara kami menggunakan informasi pribadi diuraikan di halaman Kebijakan "
"privasi. Penggunaan situs ini juga tunduk pada halaman Syarat & ketentuan."

#: templates/pages/cookies.htm:67
msgid ""
"If you have questions about cookies on this site, email "
"<strong>cata@nusantaraheritage.org</strong> (plain text; this is not a mail "
"link)."
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda punya pertanyaan tentang kuki di situs ini, kirim surel ke "
"<strong>cata@nusantaraheritage.org</strong> (teks biasa; ini bukan tautan "
"surel)."

#: templates/pages/policy_base.htm:103
msgid "Information pages"
msgstr "Halaman informasi"

#: templates/pages/privacy.htm:9
msgid ""
"This policy explains how the <strong>IPAD Indonesian Prehistoric Archaeology"
" Database</strong> (“IPAD”, “we”, “us”) uses personal information on this "
"website. After this first mention we usually say “IPAD”."
msgstr ""
"Kebijakan ini menjelaskan bagaimana <strong>IPAD Indonesian Prehistoric "
"Archaeology Database</strong> (“IPAD”, “kami”) menggunakan informasi pribadi"
" di situs web ini. Setelah penyebutan pertama ini kami biasanya menyebut "
"“IPAD”."

#: templates/pages/privacy.htm:11
msgid ""
"IPAD is the operator of this service. IPAD is the organisation responsible "
"for personal information collected through this website."
msgstr ""
"IPAD adalah pengelola layanan ini. IPAD adalah organisasi yang bertanggung "
"jawab atas informasi pribadi yang dikumpulkan melalui situs web ini."

#: templates/pages/privacy.htm:13
msgid ""
"If you have questions about personal information, email "
"<strong>cata@nusantaraheritage.org</strong> (plain text; this is not a mail "
"link)."
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda punya pertanyaan tentang informasi pribadi, kirim surel ke "
"<strong>cata@nusantaraheritage.org</strong> (teks biasa; ini bukan tautan "
"surel)."

#: templates/pages/privacy.htm:15
msgid "Policy in brief"
msgstr "Kebijakan secara ringkas"

#: templates/pages/privacy.htm:16
msgid ""
"We are committed to protecting your privacy and will only use the "
"information that we collect about you for the purposes described here. This "
"policy is intended to give you an understanding of how and why we use the "
"personal information you give us and that we receive from others."
msgstr ""
"Kami berkomitmen melindungi privasi Anda dan hanya akan menggunakan "
"informasi yang kami kumpulkan tentang Anda untuk tujuan yang diuraikan di "
"sini. Kebijakan ini dimaksudkan agar Anda memahami bagaimana dan mengapa "
"kami menggunakan informasi pribadi yang Anda berikan dan yang kami terima "
"dari pihak lain."

#: templates/pages/privacy.htm:17
msgid ""
"We recommend that you read the full policy to understand what information we"
" hold, how we may use it, how we protect it, and how to contact us."
msgstr ""
"Kami menganjurkan Anda membaca kebijakan lengkap untuk memahami informasi "
"apa yang kami simpan, bagaimana kami menggunakannya, bagaimana kami "
"melindunginya, dan cara menghubungi kami."

#: templates/pages/privacy.htm:19
msgid "Why we collect personal information"
msgstr "Mengapa kami mengumpulkan informasi pribadi"

#: templates/pages/privacy.htm:21
msgid ""
"To operate the IPAD website and search service, to respond to enquiries, to "
"administer user accounts for staff and authorised users, and to protect the "
"integrity of the database"
msgstr ""
"Untuk mengoperasikan situs web dan layanan pencarian IPAD, menjawab "
"pertanyaan, mengelola akun staf dan pengguna yang berwenang, serta "
"melindungi integritas basis data"

#: templates/pages/privacy.htm:22
msgid ""
"We only collect the information that we need or that will help us to provide"
" the service"
msgstr ""
"Kami hanya mengumpulkan informasi yang kami butuhkan atau yang membantu kami"
" menyediakan layanan"

#: templates/pages/privacy.htm:25
msgid "The types of personal information we collect"
msgstr "Jenis informasi pribadi yang kami kumpulkan"

#: templates/pages/privacy.htm:27
msgid ""
"Personal information that you choose to give us (including name, email "
"address, and similar contact details)"
msgstr ""
"Informasi pribadi yang Anda pilih untuk berikan kepada kami (termasuk nama, "
"alamat surel, dan rincian kontak serupa)"

#: templates/pages/privacy.htm:28
msgid "Account details for people who sign in (for example a username)"
msgstr "Rincian akun bagi orang yang masuk (misalnya nama pengguna)"

#: templates/pages/privacy.htm:29
msgid ""
"Technical information needed to run the website, such as session information"
" described on the Cookies page"
msgstr ""
"Informasi teknis yang diperlukan untuk menjalankan situs, seperti informasi "
"sesi yang diuraikan di halaman Kuki"

#: templates/pages/privacy.htm:32
msgid "Keeping information secure"
msgstr "Menjaga keamanan informasi"

#: templates/pages/privacy.htm:34
msgid ""
"We will never sell your personal data, and we will never share it with "
"another organisation for marketing purposes"
msgstr ""
"Kami tidak akan pernah menjual data pribadi Anda, dan tidak akan pernah "
"membagikannya kepada organisasi lain untuk tujuan pemasaran"

#: templates/pages/privacy.htm:35
msgid ""
"Information is only shared when we are required to do so by applicable law, "
"or with service providers who work for us to host or operate this website"
msgstr ""
"Informasi hanya dibagikan jika diwajibkan oleh hukum yang berlaku, atau "
"kepada penyedia layanan yang bekerja untuk kami untuk menyelenggarakan atau "
"mengoperasikan situs ini"

#: templates/pages/privacy.htm:36
msgid ""
"This website uses cookies. See the Cookies page linked at the bottom of this"
" page"
msgstr ""
"Situs ini menggunakan kuki. Lihat halaman Kuki yang tertaut di bagian bawah "
"halaman ini"

#: templates/pages/privacy.htm:38
msgid ""
"The IPAD Indonesian Prehistoric Archaeology Database does not currently use "
"analytics or marketing cookies; optional analytics or marketing cookies "
"would only be used with the visitor’s permission."
msgstr ""
"IPAD Indonesian Prehistoric Archaeology Database saat ini tidak menggunakan "
"kuki analitik atau pemasaran; kuki analitik atau pemasaran opsional hanya "
"akan digunakan dengan izin pengunjung."

#: templates/pages/privacy.htm:40
msgid "Use of information"
msgstr "Penggunaan informasi"

#: templates/pages/privacy.htm:41
msgid ""
"We do not collect personal information about you except where it is "
"specifically and knowingly given by you (for example, when you register for "
"an account, sign in, or email us), or where the website must store a session"
" cookie so that the service can function."
msgstr ""
"Kami tidak mengumpulkan informasi pribadi tentang Anda kecuali jika secara "
"khusus dan sadar diberikan oleh Anda (misalnya saat mendaftar akun, masuk, "
"atau mengirim surel kepada kami), atau jika situs harus menyimpan kuki sesi "
"agar layanan dapat berfungsi."

#: templates/pages/privacy.htm:42
msgid ""
"When personal information is collected, it may be used by us to confirm your"
" identity so we can provide our services to you, to process and fulfil "
"requests for information, and to operate and improve this website."
msgstr ""
"Jika informasi pribadi dikumpulkan, informasi itu dapat kami gunakan untuk "
"mengonfirmasi identitas Anda agar kami dapat menyediakan layanan, memproses "
"dan memenuhi permintaan informasi, serta mengoperasikan dan meningkatkan "
"situs ini."

#: templates/pages/privacy.htm:43
msgid ""
"We may share non-personal aggregated (grouped) data about visits to this "
"website, its use, and other traffic patterns with technical operators who "
"host the service for us."
msgstr ""
"Kami dapat membagikan data agregat non-pribadi (dikelompokkan) tentang "
"kunjungan ke situs ini, penggunaannya, dan pola lalu lintas lain kepada "
"operator teknis yang menyelenggarakan layanan bagi kami."

#: templates/pages/privacy.htm:44
msgid ""
"We do not sell or share information about you as an individual user of this "
"website unless you agree to us doing so, or unless we are required to do so "
"by applicable law."
msgstr ""
"Kami tidak menjual atau membagikan informasi tentang Anda sebagai pengguna "
"individu situs ini kecuali Anda menyetujuinya, atau kecuali diwajibkan oleh "
"hukum yang berlaku."

#: templates/pages/privacy.htm:45
msgid ""
"This website does not send marketing communications as part of the public "
"search service. If that ever changes, we will say so on this page first."
msgstr ""
"Situs ini tidak mengirim komunikasi pemasaran sebagai bagian dari layanan "
"pencarian publik. Jika itu pernah berubah, kami akan menyatakannya di "
"halaman ini terlebih dahulu."

#: templates/pages/privacy.htm:46
msgid ""
"When you arrive at this website from another web page, the referring page "
"name may be stored for internal administration and analysis, as described on"
" the Cookies page."
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda tiba di situs ini dari halaman web lain, nama halaman perujuk "
"dapat disimpan untuk administrasi dan analisis internal, sebagaimana "
"diuraikan di halaman Kuki."

#: templates/pages/privacy.htm:47
msgid ""
"If you have any questions concerning your personal data and how we look "
"after it, email <strong>cata@nusantaraheritage.org</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda punya pertanyaan tentang data pribadi Anda dan bagaimana kami "
"menjaganya, kirim surel ke <strong>cata@nusantaraheritage.org</strong>."

#: templates/pages/privacy.htm:50
msgid ""
"Details are on the Accessibility page linked at the bottom of this page."
msgstr ""
"Rinciannya ada di halaman Aksesibilitas yang tertaut di bagian bawah halaman"
" ini."

#: templates/pages/privacy.htm:54
msgid "Changes to this policy"
msgstr "Perubahan kebijakan ini"

#: templates/pages/privacy.htm:55
msgid ""
"We will amend this privacy policy from time to time to ensure it remains up "
"to date and accurately reflects how and why we use your personal data. The "
"current version will always be on this website."
msgstr ""
"Kami akan mengubah kebijakan privasi ini dari waktu ke waktu agar tetap "
"mutakhir dan mencerminkan secara akurat bagaimana dan mengapa kami "
"menggunakan data pribadi Anda. Versi yang berlaku selalu ada di situs web "
"ini."

#: templates/pages/terms.htm:7
msgid ""
"Please read these terms and conditions carefully before using this site. "
"These terms were published on 24 August 2026."
msgstr ""
"Harap baca syarat dan ketentuan ini dengan saksama sebelum menggunakan situs"
" ini. Syarat ini diterbitkan pada 24 Agustus 2026."

