#: templates/pages/terms.htm:21
msgid "There are other terms that may apply to you"
msgstr "Ada syarat lain yang mungkin berlaku bagi Anda"

#: templates/pages/terms.htm:22
msgid ""
"These terms of use apply to members of the public (“General Users”) who are "
